next: BLOCKED FIRST -- a fresh worktree of main cannot build at all. The new toolchain cache
  restores only lib/ and skips cli/installBin, but installBin is what WRITES the launchers, and
  only bin/ssc is tracked. So a cache HIT in a fresh worktree leaves no ssc-tools/ssc-standard.
  My three '0 errors' measurements were that: the command never ran. Fix the cache, then measure.
